  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Ghana - Aide d&apos;urgence pour la grippe aviaire</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana - Avian Flu Emergency Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to contribute to the Bird Flu Emergency Plan, and enhance the level of preparedness in combating the flu in the event of an outbreak in Ghana. It is also to strengthen national capacity to maintain functional laboratories and prepare long-term strategic plans and programmes to contain and control the spread of the pandemic should there be an outbreak.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
